ConfigureMorlockDialogue(id,
    ["I won't eat human meat... it's wrong!","They're intelligent creatures, you know - capable of all the same thoughts & feelings as we are!","Ugh... but I feel so embarrassed, if I refuse to eat human meat, it'll make my date uncomfortable...","But even so, I just can't do it... I couldn't help thinking of those poor, sunlit creatures, dying horribly for my meal..."],
